{
  "name": "Sylvan Adept",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your Words of the First World improve in the following ways:</p><ul><li><strong>Sticky Misfortune.</strong> If the reroll does not turn success into failure or vice versa, the curse instead lasts 1 minute or until it changes the outcome of a roll when you activate it the next time.</li><li><strong>Gloaming Cloak.</strong> The creature affected by your Mantle of Midnight becomes Hidden instead of Invisible, ignoring all the usual restrictions for hiding in plain view.</li><li><strong>Sylvan Farstride.</strong> Tread the Unseen Path's teleport distance increases to 60 feet.</li></ul>",
